// Type check scope for the Docker image build.
//
// Stage 2 of the root Dockerfile copies only packages/happy-wire and
// packages/happy-server — happy-app contributes just its package.json. So the
// builder can only check code that does not reach outside those two packages,
// which is exactly the code the image ships.
//
// machinesRoutes.spec.ts imports the app's real zod schema by relative path
// (`../../../../../happy-app/sources/sync/apiTypes`) as a deliberate
// cross-package contract check. That is a good test, and it cannot resolve in
// the builder. Copying happy-app/sources in to satisfy it would pull 12 MB and
// 1115 files of an unrelated package into a server image build.
//
// Spec files belong in a job with the full monorepo checked out. This config
// is not the place to check them, and excluding them here is not a claim that
// they are checked somewhere else.
{
  "extends": "./tsconfig.json",
  "exclude": ["sources/**/*.spec.ts"]
}
